[b]CCS 1.0.0-alpha.3[/b]

[list]
[*]Combos chain the way the game's do. A press during a swapped move is kept and the next step follows the hit; before, the press was dropped and only a perfectly timed press after the move chained. New Settings row [b]Next attack[/b]: after the move's first hit (the game's own way) or after its last hit, so long enemy combos play out first.[/*]
[*]Speed holds on the charge slots. The game resets the play rate when a charge releases, which threw the speed away on LC and HC. The range now goes to 4x, and the charge window grows with the speed so a hold still charges at 2x or 4x.[/*]
[*]Visual: Move's weapon hides your weapon on punches and kicks, from the first frame of the charge stage on the Axatana and Katanas, and shows it back when the move ends. CSS's MISC weapon visibility keeps its rules in every mode.[/*]
[*]Sprint heavy on the Axatana plays the S+H slot. It was routed to S+L.[/*]
[*]Moves without an icon of their own show the CCS emblem on the slot and in the list instead of the game's empty glyph.[/*]
[/list]

Update: close the game, extract the ZIP into [b]MortalShell2/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss/Mods/[/b] and overwrite. Keep settings.json and presets/ to retain your slots and presets.
